  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Kral\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\nGe\xE7mi\u015Fte
    di\u015F biledi\u011Fin d\xFC\u015Fmanlar\u0131na ve seni \xE7ekemeyenlere kar\u015F\u0131
    \xF6yle bir yere gelmi\u015F, \xF6yle g\xFC\xE7 kazanm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n ki,
    duru\u015Fun, se\xE7imlerin ve ba\u015Far\u0131n kar\u015F\u0131s\u0131nda t\u0131rnaklar\u0131n\u0131
    yemek durumunda kalm\u0131\u015Flar {{isim}}. Bu kart, kolay kolay kimselerin
    varamayaca\u011F\u0131 bir m\xFCkemmelli\u011Fe ula\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6steriyor. \xD6n\xFCne \xE7\u0131kan f\u0131rsatlar\u0131 daima k\xFC\xE7\xFCk
    b\xFCy\xFCk demeden en iyi \u015Fekilde de\u011Ferlendirmi\u015Fsin. Yan\u0131na
    insanlar\u0131n en vefal\u0131lar\u0131, hanene ise e\u015Fyan\u0131n en u\u011Furlusu
    kat\u0131lm\u0131\u015F. G\xF6z kama\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 pozisyonun, nadide
    imkanlar\u0131n ve \xE7evrendeki de\u011Ferli kalabal\u0131kla, her zaman birileri
    taraf\u0131ndan k\u0131skan\u0131lm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n."
